    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOL-xLQ87H6N5M",
      "title": "fix(op-acceptor): use -skip flag for named test exclusions in gateless mode",
      "author": "scharissis",
      "number": 560,
      "body": "## Summary\n\n- Fix `--exclude-gates` not working for named tests in gateless mode. In gateless mode, validators have `FuncName=\"\"` (RunAll), so tuple matches (`package+name`) against the empty `FuncName` always failed — causing excluded named tests to run anyway.\n- Instead of dropping the entire package validator, collect matching test names into a new `SkipTests` field on `ValidatorMetadata` and emit Go's `-skip` flag when building test arguments.\n- Package-level exclusions (`byPackage`) still drop validators entirely, preserving existing behavior.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `go test ./registry/... -run TestExcludeGates -v` — all 4 tests pass including new `TestExcludeGates_NamedTest_Gateless`\n- [x] `go test ./runner/... -run TestBuildTestArgs -v` — all 4 cases pass including new \"run all with skip tests\"\n- [x] `go vet ./...` passes\n- [ ] CI passes\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/infra",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-04T15:31:15Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-03-04T15:39:02Z",
      "additions": 127,
      "deletions": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOL-xLQ87H6oc3",
      "title": "fix(ci): install zstd for mise archive extraction in go-release job",
      "author": "scharissis",
      "number": 561,
      "body": "## Summary\n- The mise installer now ships `.tar.zst` archives, but the `ci-builder` Docker image used by the `go-release` job lacks `zstd`, causing the \"Setup mise\" step to fail with `zstd: Cannot exec: No such file or directory`\n- Adds `apt-get install zstd` before the mise install command to fix the extraction\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Trigger a release build for op-acceptor and verify the \"Setup mise\" step passes\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/infra",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-04T15:55:18Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-03-04T17:46:08Z",
      "additions": 2,
